  "purpose": "These three sequences separate the three put conflict modes, the presence/absence of the AFTER INSERT trigger, and the three channel definitions. Sequence 1 distinguishes INSERT OR IGNORE from INSERT OR REPLACE/ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE via committed value and channel. Sequence 2 distinguishes trigger firing on ignored inserts and rollback effects. Sequence 3 distinguishes main-only counters from main+other counters and trigger firing on cross-connection updates."
